--- !u!114 &1181465091
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1181465089}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b096626d39e2f7dd882348b9cb85cb8b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.InWorldScreen
  range: 1.6
  point: {fileID: 1264440479}
  clip: {fileID: 0}
  faces:
  - {fileID: 687329940}
  lines:
  - at: 1
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: If you're watching this, then somebody you love is very sick, and I'm sorry.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 6.98
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: I'm not going to rush you through anything tonight, nobody's going to come
      in and hurry you, I just want to tell you what the Translation is, and what
      it asks of you, and then you can sit with it as long as you need.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 14.780001
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: The first bodies were steel, heavy and cold, and the people who chose them
      knew that going in, and they chose them anyway so the rest of us wouldn't have
      to.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 22.580002
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: The second had skin over the steel, and that was better, and it still wasn't
      enough.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 29.000002
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: This one we call the Glorified Body. It feels, it heals, and it doesn't
      get sick, it doesn't get old, and it doesn't get tired.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 36.800003
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: Now, the Translation hurts, and I'll never tell you otherwise. There's
      swelling, there's weeks of therapy, and your child's going to learn to walk
      again, and to hold a cup.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 44.600002
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: But your child won't be alone in any of it, not for one hour.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 49.755
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: You'll see they keep the face covered, not from shame, from hope.
    skipIfFlag: 
  - at: 55.13
    speaker: THE PROGRAM
    text: Whatever you decide tonight, you're family here. So that humanity thrives.
    skipIfFlag: 
  interactive: 1
  loop: 1
  hearing: 12
  volume: 1
  ducksMusic: 1
  pausesTape: 1
  thing: the screen
  watchable: 0
  watchStill: {fileID: 0}
  creditsStill: {fileID: 0}
  endComment: 
  endLog: {fileID: 0}
